imivihje on merkitty erikseen.</p></div><label class="catalog-search">Hae DLC-kokoelmasta<input type="search" data-catalog-search="dlcCatalog" placeholder="Hae nimellä tai tiedostolla…" /></label><p data-catalog-count="dlcCatalog" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="dlcCatalog"><details class="catalog-entry" data-catalog-item><summary><strong>/</strong><span>text/html · Alkuperäinen tiedosto tallennettu; lähiluku erikseen</span></summary><p><code>http://www.dlc.fi:80/~hyk/</code></p><p><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/19970304214306/http://www.dlc.fi:80/~hyk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DLC-0001 · 19970304 ↗</a></p></details><details class="catalog-entry" data-catalog-item><summary><strong>/</strong><span>text/html · Arkistoitu virhevastaus 404</span></summary><p><code>http://www.dlc.fi:80/~hyk%0a/</code></p><p><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20010516211553/http://www.dlc.fi:80/~hyk%0a/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DLC-0002 · 20010516 ↗</a></p></details><details class="catalog-entry" data-catalog-item><summary><strong>.htm</strong><span>text/html · Arkistoitu virhevastaus 403</span></summary><p><code>http://www.dlc.fi:80/~hyk/.htm</code></p><p><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20020718234613/http://www.dlc.fi:80/~hyk/.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DLC-0003 · 20020718 ↗</a></p></details><details class="catalog-entry" data-catalog-item><summary><strong>03-syyskirje.pdf</strong><span>application/pdf · Alkuperäinen tiedosto tallennettu; lähiluku erikseen</span></summary><p><code>http://www.dlc.fi:80/~hyk/03-syyskirje.pdf</code></p><p><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20040122175407/http://www.dlc.fi:80/~hyk/03-syyskirje.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DLC-0004 · 20040122 ↗</a></p></details><details class="catalog-entry" data-catalog-item><summary><strong>0408668726.pdf</strong><span>application/pdf · Alkuperäinen tiedosto tallennettu; lähiluku erikseen</span></summary><p><code>http://www.dlc.fi:80/~